  {
   "id": "fqffw93s1nqr",
   "q": "What ages do you teach?",
   "a": "Lil' Ninjas is for ages 4–6. Kids move into Levels 1–3 (White belt through Brown/Stripe), and our Adults/Teens classes welcome every belt level — parents can train too.",
