   "order": 1
  },
  {
   "id": "fqj1bdoofnqr",
   "q": "How do belts and stripes work?",
   "a": "Students earn a stripe for each part of their belt: yellow for core techniques, green for combos, blue for forms, red for self defense, and black when they're ready to test. Lil' Ninjas earn 8 stripes: discipline, balance, memory, control, teamwork, focus, coordination and fitness.",
   "qEs": "¿Cómo funcionan los cinturones y franjas?",
